HeroDeathResurrect Hero Dies
    Events
        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                ((Triggering unit) is in Companion_Group.) Equal to True
                (Triggering unit) Equal to Nazgrek
                (Triggering unit) Equal to Zulkis
    Actions
        -------- ============================================ --------
        Set VariableSet CV = (Custom value of (Triggering unit))
        Set VariableSet NPC_DeathPoint = (Position of (Triggering unit))
        Set VariableSet NPC_Deceased[CV] = (Triggering unit)
        -------- ============================================ --------
        Unit - Create 1 Deceased for (Owner of NPC_Deceased[CV]) at NPC_DeathPoint facing Default building facing degrees
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                    Conditions
                        (Triggering unit) Equal to Nazgrek
                        (Triggering unit) Equal to Zulkis
            Then - Actions
                -------- Player Hero time --------
                Unit - Add a 30.00 second Generic expiration timer to (Last created unit)
            Else - Actions
                -------- AI Hero time --------
                Unit - Add a 60.00 second Generic expiration timer to (Last created unit)
        Set VariableSet CV_Deceased = (Custom value of (Last created unit))
        Set VariableSet NPC_DeceasedTarget[CV_Deceased] = (Last created unit)
        Set VariableSet NPC_DeceasedHero[CV_Deceased] = CV
        -------- ============================================ --------
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_NPC_DeathPoint)
        -------- ============================================ --------
        -------- Enable AI heroes to resurrect fallen Player or AI heroes --------
        Trigger - Turn on HeroDeathResurrect AI Hero Reviver <gen>
